subproblems.statement:
Let P, n ∈ ℕ and let U, W ⊆ ℝ^P be arbitrary sets. Let T ∈ GeometricCurrentOn U n, ω ∈ TestFormOn U n and B, C ∈ ℝ, and assume:
- B ≥ 0 and T.massOn W ≤ ENNReal.ofReal B;
- tsupport ω ⊆ W;
- |ω(x)| ≤ C for every x ∈ ℝ^P, where |·| = covectorEuclideanNorm.
Then |T(ω)| ≤ B·C.
